    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, even though I have a master's degree in computer science. While I appreciate its logical structure and problem-solving aspects, it often feels abstract and overwhelming. My father, who holds a PhD, was more inclined toward math, which made my relationship with the subject feel like a constant comparison. I prefer subjects where I can see immediate applications or historical significance, like history or computer science.",
