    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I haven’t used AI specifically for math learning recently, but I’ve explored tools like Wolfram Alpha for quick calculations or problem-solving. While these tools are powerful, they often feel impersonal and lack the depth of understanding I seek. I prefer hands-on practice with real-world problems or coding applications where math is more tangible.",
